        <mxCell id="wav2vec" value="wav2vec2&#10;(Emotion)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="760" y="210" width="160" height="50" as="geometry" />
